Need Wi-Fi in a Japanese cafe? Ask this 📶
Not every cafe advertises it, so ask.

Today's phrases:
• Wi-Fiは ありますか (wai fai wa arimasu ka) = Do you have Wi-Fi?
• パスワード (pasuwaado) = Password
• おしえて ください (oshiete kudasai) = Please tell me

